{"candidateAnswer":"A national park in the northern part of the state","evidence":"[D5:8 | 10:47 am on 6 May, 2023] Audrey: That's a good plan! I'm lucky to have a park near me - it's great for my pup's walks. Last Friday we took a road trip - we went to a beautiful national park and my dogs had a blast! It was an awesome trip!\n[D11:9 | 9:48 am on 8 July, 2023] Andrew: Looking forward to seeing them have fun hiking. Let's get planning for next month! Here's the map for the trail.","itemId":"urn:uuid:8e9c45f7-ffbe-5b36-93e4-43a1e45984bc","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:689dc6d22fc0c7b2715e77c1f32943fb9a37478dd48e37bab262bde667de4528","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which national park could Audrey and Andrew be referring to in their conversations?","referenceAnswer":"Voyageurs National Park","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"689dc6d22fc0c7b2715e77c1f32943fb9a37478dd48e37bab262bde667de4528"}}]}